{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30017_01_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a6db721359b6e164fe55c35964083c5a7c0fe837e087af688adccf05afb1c7c7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90e940a55dee37fab24492d586b3b78854d7faa0f0e19a39bc5692515bc4b818",
      "text": "……太好啦！\n刚才那把感觉相当不错呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a17924f9af640dcfee9b597328dc25efa0fd1adcf7af99a208fa5268e9236604",
      "text": "连击也啪啪啪全接上了呢。\n……“SS级”！？大吾君太厉害了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6abe66fd4905a37a3d8e1ef07ed7f215b39335dcf14b8eed2859a4220a7525f9",
      "text": "…真了不起。在最高难度的谱面下，\n居然能打出这么高的分数。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61d24836909f16423b3422a4bf861d36b4f941dd169bcc1ec21da4b4267714de",
      "text": "哇哈哈！看来今天状态极佳啊！\n保持这个势头，感觉能拿到更高的分数呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1697cf5a2f41145cd005026630854716c4902a88e1f9adc0eeaee27ef4d6a3d",
      "text": "……各位，拍摄马上就要开始了哦。\n大吾先生，正式录制也请保持这个状态加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000109:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b6fd93d031af51cd031e5eb9eaceb95f88771b273c1585a0aec5619ea1d2df5",
      "text": "游玩画面拍摄结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f85ce897793d16500d0f0c011e910cfb005f51cb33e88ce404a64a584c1d585",
      "text": "…剩下的就只有录制感想留言了。\n拍摄进行得很顺利，总算能松口气了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da45a7fdc77cea70753fdbe4468c2040dddb845128c57a0e3e51c85714c6989e",
      "text": "是啊。和一希先生一起“合作游玩”，在正式拍摄时\n也拿到了“S级”……啊，对了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:525eeb8823ee82cbef3c80126dd3450f763e544f4422fa24e316f74d4256b645",
      "text": "我想稍微请教一下……这个\n“评级”，最高能达到多少级呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25f82a4369edf4134fcf316b2ea0c06de3b4f676376821d6823ae4153f957de9",
      "text": "最高有“SSS级”哦。\n不过难度可以说是相当高呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000156:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa8dcf12406ed9eecde1fdadd20e42ce574f01fe9b8756df35f24061be5ccb28",
      "text": "哎！居然还有SSS吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000175:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b49c8ee5cf462192f93a48853b963cd7d85780160a0ca3dbf89b6b974a27faf",
      "text": "原来不是到“SS级”就结束了啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
